# Third-party notices

## O*NET database

PocketResume's skill directory is derived from the O*NET 31.0 Database
(Software Skills, Essential Skills, and Transferable Skills files), published by
the U.S. Department of Labor, Employment and Training Administration.

The bundled job title directory is derived from the O*NET 31.0 Database
(Sample of Reported Titles and Job Titles files), published by the same agency.

- Source: https://www.onetcenter.org/database.html
- License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
- License text: https://www.onetcenter.org/license_db.html

The bundled snapshots live in `libs/skills-lexicon.js` and
`libs/title-directory-global.js` and are regenerated with
`npm run build:lexicon` and `npm run build:titles`. Updates downloaded by the
extension are stored locally and are not redistributed.

## GeoNames

PocketResume's bundled location directory is derived from the GeoNames
`cities15000` dataset.

- Source: https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/
- License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
- License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The bundled snapshot lives in `libs/location-directory-global.js` and is
regenerated with `npm run build:locations`. Updates downloaded by the extension
are stored locally and are not redistributed.

